                            "To prickle or tingle."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f27e0e83-31cc-447b-82ff-1da5748004d3",
                                "sense_id": "8c1606a1-1e45-3c56-b6b4-4a14e3e2b430",
                                "text": "My word, my skin pringled all over as I listened to him, and I would gladly have changed my position for that of the first man in the steepest and narrowest breach that ever swallowed up a storming party."
                            }
                        ]
